@title Mother 3 (Japan)
@file Mother 3 (J).gba
@game A3UJ
@chip FLASH512
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# New game: every name by おまかせ (default) + START (cursor to おわり) + A,
# message speed はやい, confirm. Chapter 1 at Alec's house: Lucas comes
# downstairs, is sent back up to change out of his pyjamas, goes outside,
# walks past the pig pen to the south-east, where a frog (カエル) explains
# saving; はい, slot 1, "セーブちゅうです".
# Findings: the flash save takes a different time on each emulator (the
# screen changes dingbat-bios+30, nba+35, mgba+65 frames after the slot is
# picked), and the mgba save differs from dingbat-bios/nba (which are
# byte-identical). In the bedroom (~f12200) and during the circle-wipe after
# changing clothes (~f13968) the three show different animation phases /
# wipe radii.
[new]
wait 600
press A
wait 1220
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 200
wait 60
press START
wait 150
tap DOWN times=6 every=10 hold=4
wait 10
press A
